## 诊断结论

```json
{
  "paper_url": "https://aclanthology.org/2021.eacl-main.219/",
  "paper_accessible": true,
  "paper_metrics_claimed": [
    {"metric": "BLEU", "value": "~0.65-0.66 (varies by beam size/method)", "dataset": "E2E NLG Challenge test set", "setting": "vanilla beam search vs incremental beam-manipulation reranker, beam sizes 3/5/10/30"}
  ],
  "env_analysis": {
    "python_version_required": "3.6/3.7 (Python3, no f-strings/async issues; TF/Keras pins target py3.6-3.7 era)",
    "framework_required": "tensorflow==1.15.2, Keras==2.3.1, torch==1.4.0, torchtext==0.5.0, spacy==2.2.3, gensim==3.8.1 (see requirements.txt, pinned exactly)",
    "evidence": "requirements.txt pins exact versions; README instructs pip3 install -r requirements.txt into a venv; also requires cloning UFAL-DSG/tgen, tuetschek/e2e-metrics, thushv89/attention_keras and installing ufal/pytreex, plus manual sed patches to e2e_metrics"
  },
  "docker": {
    "images_tried": ["python:2.7 (not needed, ruled out)", "python:3.7-slim (probe)", "tensorflow/tensorflow:1.15.2-gpu-py3"],
    "image_used": "tensorflow/tensorflow:1.15.2-gpu-py3 (Python 3.6.9 inside)",
    "pull_success": true,
    "run_command": "docker run -d --name ibm_repro -v /tmp/ibm_work:/work -v $(pwd):/repo:ro -w /work tensorflow/tensorflow:1.15.2-gpu-py3 sleep 36000; docker exec ibm_repro pip3 install -r requirements.txt; docker exec ibm_repro git clone tgen/e2e-metrics/attention_keras"
  },
  "install": {
    "status": "success",
    "log_tail": "All packages in requirements.txt installed successfully (verified via pip list diff, 0 missing) after retrying past intermittent PyPI read-timeouts. git had to be installed via apt after removing a broken/unsigned NVIDIA apt repo entry inside the container (container-config fix only, no repo code touched). tgen, e2e_metrics, attention_keras cloned successfully from GitHub."
  },
  "data": {
    "datasets_needed": ["E2E NLG Challenge dataset (trainset.csv/devset.csv/testset.csv)"],
    "available_in_repo": true,
    "downloaded": [],
    "license_blocked": []
  },
  "run": {
    "command": "python3 train_seq2seq.py -c new_configs/model_configs/seq2seq_model.yaml  (prerequisite step for get_results.py / vanilla_beam_search.yaml / bm pipeline)",
    "status": "not_run - infeasible within time/hardware budget",
    "output_tail": "seq2seq_model.yaml specifies epoch: 150, min_epoch: 30, train_batch_size: 16 over a ~42k-example train set (e2e-dataset/trainset.csv, verified present, 42064 lines). This is a from-scratch seq2seq training run that normally needs a GPU and runs for a substantial time. The sandbox's Docker daemon has no NVIDIA Container Toolkit configured ('could not select device driver with capabilities: [[gpu]]'), so the container can only use CPU, even though the host itself reports a GPU via nvidia-smi. CPU training of 150 epochs of a seq2seq model, followed by beam-manipulator training and multiple beam-search/bleu-scoring passes (the full paper pipeline: train_seq2seq -> get_results vanilla -> get_results setup_bm_traindata -> train_beam_manipulator -> get_results bm_test -> get_results_bleu_scores) is well beyond any single 10-minute execution window and the remaining tool-call budget."
  },
  "actual_results": null,
  "repro_verdict": "blocked_hardware",
  "blocker_attribution": "pipeline",
  "verdict_reason": "环境搭建完全成功(数据在库内、依赖装齐、三个外部仓库克隆成功),但整条复现链路(seq2seq 150 epoch 预训练 + beam-manipulator 训练 + 多组 beam search/BLEU 评估)本质上需要 GPU 且耗时很长;当前 Docker 沙箱未配置 nvidia-container-toolkit,容器内无法使用宿主机 GPU,只能 CPU 跑,不可能在给定时间/调用预算内跑出论文数字,因此在真正开始训练前停止,如实标记为硬件受限而非直接伪造结果。"
}
```

**要点总结**：
- 论文可访问，主表是 E2E NLG 数据集上不同 beam size 下 vanilla beam search vs incremental beam-manipulation 的 BLEU。
- 环境线索明确指向 TF 1.15.2 + Keras 2.3.1 + torch 1.4.0（requirements.txt 精确锁定版本），对应 Python 3.6/3.7 时代。
- 用 `tensorflow/tensorflow:1.15.2-gpu-py3` 镜像（含 Python 3.6.9）成功拉取并搭建：pip 依赖全部装齐、`tgen`/`e2e-metrics`/`attention_keras` 三个外部仓库全部 clone 成功，E2E 数据集已在仓库内（trainset/devset/testset.csv 都在）。
- 真正的训练在容器里无法用 GPU（sandbox 的 Docker 没配 nvidia-container-toolkit，`--gpus all` 报错），而配置要求 150 epoch 的 seq2seq 训练+后续 beam-manipulator 训练+多组 beam search/BLEU 评估，CPU 跑不完也超出时间预算，因此没有强行跑、没有伪造数字，如实标记为 `blocked_hardware` / `pipeline` 归因。
- 未修改仓库任何代码；对容器内部 apt 源做的调整（移除失效签名的 NVIDIA apt 仓库）仅是容器环境配置,不涉及论文代码库本身。

